WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.387
Ugochukwu needs help with his school fees,

2
00:00:06.387 --> 00:00:08.009
and so having created an account,

3
00:00:08.009 --> 00:00:10.727
he signs up to the website and goes ahead
to create a cause.

4
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:13.408
As you can see, he doesn't just fill a
form.

5
00:00:13.408 --> 00:00:15.015
This is an interview with AI,

6
00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:17.780
and that is a real live model answering.

7
00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:20.112
It asks for what exactly the money is for.

8
00:00:20.112 --> 00:00:21.474
It asks for who exactly gets paid,

9
00:00:21.474 --> 00:00:23.478
how much will be paid, and when exactly
the money is due.

10
00:00:23.478 --> 00:00:26.083
You can see it asks for the Remita
reference

11
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:28.544
in this case, because he claims to be a

12
00:00:28.544 --> 00:00:30.212
student of a federal university who wants
to pay

13
00:00:30.212 --> 00:00:31.385
his fees.

14
00:00:31.385 --> 00:00:33.473
This is the detail that he cannot forge,

15
00:00:33.473 --> 00:00:35.393
and even if it seems like the AI
interviewer

16
00:00:35.393 --> 00:00:36.992
isn't thorough in drilling him for
document proofs and

17
00:00:36.992 --> 00:00:39.605
the like, it notes this verifiable detail
and goes

18
00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:41.627
ahead to create the case for him.

19
00:00:42.337 --> 00:00:45.132
And then out comes the published itemised
budget,

20
00:00:45.132 --> 00:00:46.877
with the receiver of the money clearly
stated.

21
00:00:46.877 --> 00:00:49.063
In this case, three hundred thousand naira
to be

22
00:00:49.063 --> 00:00:50.592
paid to the University of Lagos.

23
00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:52.710
He then proves who he is,

24
00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:54.690
with his NIN and his face matched against
the

25
00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:55.764
registry.

26
00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:58.065
This is important, because an NIN number
can be

27
00:00:58.065 --> 00:00:59.291
leaked, but not a live face.

28
00:00:59.981 --> 00:01:01.588
And this is where it runs the fraud check.

29
00:01:01.588 --> 00:01:04.338
It scans for reused images, contradictory
dates and unrealistic

30
00:01:04.338 --> 00:01:07.066
budgets, and also in this case a valid
Remita

31
00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:09.052
number that is actually owned by
Ugochukwu.

32
00:01:13.267 --> 00:01:15.492
Now, we see a donor named Okefe,

33
00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:17.945
who gives a hundred and fifty thousand
naira.

34
00:01:17.945 --> 00:01:20.116
Before he agreed, he is shown what we
would take.

35
00:01:20.116 --> 00:01:23.620
This is tentatively two percent, capped at
five thousand naira.

36
00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:26.588
All this lands in escrow, not in Ugo's
account.

37
00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:32.856
While signing up on Kairos is very easy,
some

38
00:01:32.856 --> 00:01:35.577
people might still choose not to and so
Ugochukwu

39
00:01:35.577 --> 00:01:38.300
can copy this link and paste it on any

40
00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:40.417
social media platform, WhatsApp in this
case.

41
00:01:40.798 --> 00:01:42.893
Anyone who sees this link can click on it

42
00:01:42.893 --> 00:01:44.987
or copy it and paste it in any browser.

43
00:01:45.369 --> 00:01:48.282
Now this potential donor pastes it on the
private

44
00:01:48.282 --> 00:01:51.196
browser and as you can see the donation
will

45
00:01:51.196 --> 00:01:51.843
be anonymous.

46
00:01:58.504 --> 00:02:00.278
Now, on the left is Ugochukwu's account,

47
00:02:00.278 --> 00:02:02.229
and on the right is another potential
donor,

48
00:02:02.229 --> 00:02:03.577
namely Abigail.

49
00:02:03.577 --> 00:02:07.287
These are two separate browsers with the
named accounts logged in.

50
00:02:07.287 --> 00:02:10.692
Now as you can see, a hundred

51
00:02:10.692 --> 00:02:12.429
and forty seven thousand naira has been
raised by

52
00:02:12.429 --> 00:02:13.816
Okefe, and a hundred and fifty three
thousand naira

53
00:02:13.816 --> 00:02:14.714
is still needed.

54
00:02:16.276 --> 00:02:17.898
Abigail donates this balance.

55
00:02:17.898 --> 00:02:19.627
Before she agrees to pay, notice that she
is

56
00:02:19.627 --> 00:02:21.318
told what portion of the amount will be
taken

57
00:02:21.318 --> 00:02:22.408
to maintain the app.

58
00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:25.287
As earlier mentioned, this is our
tentative business model.

59
00:02:25.287 --> 00:02:26.826
We resort to this when we are unable to

60
00:02:26.826 --> 00:02:28.251
get any sponsors at all.

61
00:02:30.506 --> 00:02:32.174
Notice also that as soon as she gives this

62
00:02:32.174 --> 00:02:35.716
money, it updates automatically
everywhere, and Ugo gets a

63
00:02:35.716 --> 00:02:38.200
notification that his money is complete.

64
00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.406
Now, let's look at Ugo's wallet.

65
00:02:41.406 --> 00:02:43.229
Notice that this money does not land in
Ugo's

66
00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:46.152
account, neither can Ugo even withdraw any
of it.

67
00:02:46.152 --> 00:02:49.123
The money is kept in escrow with a
licensed

68
00:02:49.123 --> 00:02:51.027
partner, and Ugo cannot touch any of it.

69
00:02:52.194 --> 00:02:54.272
He clicks on Pay fees, and the AI,

70
00:02:54.272 --> 00:02:56.246
after getting results from the API,

71
00:02:56.246 --> 00:02:59.498
confirms the biller, the amount, and
checks if it

72
00:02:59.498 --> 00:03:01.547
is unpaid, and then it settles it.

73
00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:03.543
We then get a receipt from the university.

74
00:03:05.005 --> 00:03:05.684
As soon as this payment is made,

75
00:03:05.684 --> 00:03:09.706
Abigail gets notified that Ugo's fees has
been paid,

76
00:03:09.706 --> 00:03:11.298
as well as a breakdown of what portion of

77
00:03:11.298 --> 00:03:13.004
her donation paid the fees.

78
00:03:13.004 --> 00:03:14.444
She does not just get a thank you,

79
00:03:14.444 --> 00:03:17.217
she gets a receipt, one that she can
inspect herself.

